{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Cap Child Maintenance: 10% of a paying parent\u2019s basic salary excluding overtime",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We want the Government to cap child maintenance payments at 10% of a paying parent's basic salary, excluding overtime. We also propose a minimum payment of \u00a3210 per month for parents in full-time employment \u2013 which is roughly 10% of the minimum wage based off a 40hr week, minus any deductions.",
